{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Knot.KashaevAsymptoticBounds","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Knot.KashaevAsymptoticBounds","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Knot.KashaevFullSum","lean:module:QOU.Knot.KashaevLogAsymptotic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.kashaev_bounds_of_model","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.kashaev_bounds_of_model","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevAsymptoticBounds.lean#L67-L98","doc":"**`⟨4₁⟩_N`, above and below, with no `g_{k*}`.**\n\n`err ≤ model` is what keeps the lower bound from being vacuous — without it the\nleft-hand side is negative and says nothing.  It is exactly the condition step\n18's error has to satisfy before the constant is readable, and it holds for `N`\npast a threshold. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.kashaevProd_argmax_bounds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.kashaevProd_argmax_bounds","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevAsymptoticBounds.lean#L50-L65","doc":"**The peak term, bracketed.**  `g_{k*} = e^{log g_{k*}}`, and step 7\nbrackets the exponent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.abs_log_kashaevProd_argmax_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.abs_log_kashaevProd_argmax_le","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevAsymptoticBounds.lean#L45-L48","doc":"Step 7 in the named form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.peakLogErr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.peakLogErr","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevAsymptoticBounds.lean#L38-L43","doc":"The error of `log g_{k*}` — step 7's, named. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.peakLogMain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.peakLogMain","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevAsymptoticBounds.lean#L31-L36","doc":"The main term of `log g_{k*}` — step 7's, named. ","signatureChunk":0}]}